Event(s):	TAM (Tamanrasset) * LATITUDE: 22.790300 * LONGITUDE: 5.529200 * DATE/TIME: 2000-03-01T00:00:00 * ELEVATION: 1385.0 m * LOCATION: Algeria * METHOD/DEVICE: Monitoring station (MONS) * COMMENT: BSRN station no: 42; Surface type: desert, rock; Topography type: flat, rural; Horizon: doi:10.1594/PANGAEA.669526; Station scientist: Sidi BAIKA (s.baika@meteo.dz)
Comment:	On 2018-02-22 the tracker experienced problems and has stopped working since then. Therefore no DIF nor DIR data is available. Also note, that the Pyrgeometer has not been shaded since then and that the SWD pyranometer is not ventilated. To have at least some DIF data, a shadowband was reinstalled for the diffuse sensor on 4th of April 2022. The DIF data is to be taken with care.
